% Our research makes three key contributions to address these challenges. First, through a comprehensive quantitative analysis of existing datasets, we uncover that nearly half of the labeled cases are inaccurate, highlighting a critical gap in current CCI research. Second, we introduce \bench, a meticulously curated dataset that establishes a new quality standard for CCI detection and repair tasks. Third, we present \name, an innovative end-to-end framework that seamlessly integrates deep learning-based detection with LLM-based repair capabilities.
