\section{Introduction}
\label{Introduction}
    Multimodal large language models (MLLMs)\cite{GPT4V,lu2024deepseek,liu2023visualllava,bai2023qwen,zhu2023minigpt4} extend the capabilities of large language models (LLMs)\cite{touvron2023llama,vicuna2023,jiang2024mixtral} to visual inputs, enabling unified language–vision reasoning. 
    % By combining pretrained vision encoders with frozen or instruction-tuned LLM backbones,
    Despite strong performance across multimodal tasks, MLLMs remain vulnerable to multimodal jailbreak attacks~\cite{luo2024jailbreakv28k, gong2025figstep, dong2023visual}, raising critical safety concerns for secure deployment.

