\subsection{Benign Features Restoration}
    \vspace{-2mm}
\label{method:component2}
% After pruning harmful tokens in layers $[n, n + \Delta_n]$, the subsequent layers (e.g., $[9,31]$ in LLaVA-1.5-7B, $[9,11]$ in DeepSeek-VL2, and $[11,31]$ in MiniGPT-4-7B) operate on incomplete representations, lacking fine-grained interactions among input tokens. 
